{
    "title": "Paper Boy Race: Running game",
    "description": "Get on your motorbike, racer! \ud83d\udef5 Teleport to the world of this running game, where you\u2019ll be driving through obstacles as a paperboy to win this thrilling race! \ud83c\udfc1\ud83c\udfae\u2728\r\n\r\nEmbark on an endless adventure with this bike delivery sim and go down in the history of our bike racing game\u2014Paper Boy Race\u2014as a legendary racing master! \ud83c\udfc6 Meet our exciting run 3D sim about racing\u2014Paper Boy Race! You\u2019ll take the role of a paperboy working in delivery! Collect every coin, don\u2019t miss the mailboxes, and drive through the city during the bike race! \ud83d\udef5\ud83d\udcf0 \r\n\r\nThe main challenge of our delivery game is that it\u2019s not so easy working as a postman in this busy city! There will be a lot of racing cars and other hurdles in your way. Move carefully on your moto to complete your traffic run 3D tasks safe and sound! \ud83d\udef5\u2728\r\n \r\n\ud83c\udfc1 Maneuver to overcome obstacles \ud83c\udfc1\r\nEvade the racing cars and trains, throw newspapers into mailboxes, and don\u2019t run into road signs during every bike race 3D. This running game will put your navigation skills and reaction speed to the test! Get ready to perform thrilling motorbike stunts in your moto-race to complete every delivery and leave other runners behind in the world of these runner games!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Collect every coin on the road to upgrade \ud83c\udfc6\r\nDon\u2019t miss a coin on the road in this bike racing game. You can spend coins on new outfits for your paper-boy or paper-girl and upgrade your bicycle for a motorcycle race, or win exciting prizes by spinning the fortune wheel or completing daily tasks in this runner! Run away to the world of motorcycle racing games to unwind and test your skills in the bike race 3D!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udef5 Join the moto-race for relaxation \ud83d\udef5\r\nThis ultimate motorcycle simulator combines the excitement of platform games with the well-known mechanics of obstacle games. It will steal your heart with its high-end graphics, charming postman, amazing bike race, and addictive bicycle racing through various themed cities. The simple gameplay and crisp visuals set this endless runner apart from other motorcycle racing games. Run away from your everyday routine and dive into this crazy rush from our running game!\r\n\r\nWhether you're no stranger to running games or only beginning to explore the world of platform games, you\u2019ll love this endless runner! Take the papers, make your motorbike run and jump over hurdles, and beat others in the thrilling run race. \ud83c\udfae\u2728\r\n\r\nForget about other running games\u2014our crazy runner will get you hooked for hours!\r\n\r\nHere are the features of our scooter game:\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Crisp graphics: Unlike other runner games, this delivery game will surprise you with its bright visuals and the mega fun of a motorcycle race.\r\n\u2728 Never-ending speed challenge: Test your skills and find out how good you are as a paper delivery boy to beat unique levels in this exciting bike delivery girls&boys game.\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Crazy rush: Drive ahead at high speed and make your bike run and jump over other cars to become the racing master of this girls&boys game about racing.\r\n\ud83c\udfae Addictive gameplay: Our scooter game will quickly become your favorite time-killer among other obstacle games, thanks to its intuitive mechanics.\r\n\ud83d\udcf0 Fascinating paper delivery boy tasks: Deliver papers, dodge obstacles, and prove your paperboy or papergirl can complete every traffic rider mission in the race!\r\n\ud83d\udef5 Plenty of vehicles: In this game, you can drive anything, from a skateboard to a motercycle!\r\n\r\nGet on your motercycle and drive ahead to deliver every paper in this exciting run race 3D! Download our running sim and become the legendary racer of all runners! \ud83d\udef5\ud83c\udfc1\ud83c\udfae",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get on your motorbike, racer! \ud83d\udef5 Teleport to the world of this running game, where you\u2019ll be driving through obstacles as a paperboy to win this thrilling race! \ud83c\udfc1\ud83c\udfae\u2728<br><br>Embark on an endless adventure with this bike delivery sim and go down in the history of our bike racing game\u2014Paper Boy Race\u2014as a legendary racing master! \ud83c\udfc6 Meet our exciting run 3D sim about racing\u2014Paper Boy Race! You\u2019ll take the role of a paperboy working in delivery! Collect every coin, don\u2019t miss the mailboxes, and drive through the city during the bike race! \ud83d\udef5\ud83d\udcf0 <br><br>The main challenge of our delivery game is that it\u2019s not so easy working as a postman in this busy city! There will be a lot of racing cars and other hurdles in your way. Move carefully on your moto to complete your traffic run 3D tasks safe and sound! \ud83d\udef5\u2728<br> <br>\ud83c\udfc1 Maneuver to overcome obstacles \ud83c\udfc1<br>Evade the racing cars and trains, throw newspapers into mailboxes, and don\u2019t run into road signs during every bike race 3D. This running game will put your navigation skills and reaction speed to the test! Get ready to perform thrilling motorbike stunts in your moto-race to complete every delivery and leave other runners behind in the world of these runner games!<br><br>\ud83c\udfc6 Collect every coin on the road to upgrade \ud83c\udfc6<br>Don\u2019t miss a coin on the road in this bike racing game. You can spend coins on new outfits for your paper-boy or paper-girl and upgrade your bicycle for a motorcycle race, or win exciting prizes by spinning the fortune wheel or completing daily tasks in this runner! Run away to the world of motorcycle racing games to unwind and test your skills in the bike race 3D!<br><br>\ud83d\udef5 Join the moto-race for relaxation \ud83d\udef5<br>This ultimate motorcycle simulator combines the excitement of platform games with the well-known mechanics of obstacle games. It will steal your heart with its high-end graphics, charming postman, amazing bike race, and addictive bicycle racing through various themed cities. The simple gameplay and crisp visuals set this endless runner apart from other motorcycle racing games. Run away from your everyday routine and dive into this crazy rush from our running game!<br><br>Whether you&#39;re no stranger to running games or only beginning to explore the world of platform games, you\u2019ll love this endless runner! Take the papers, make your motorbike run and jump over hurdles, and beat others in the thrilling run race. \ud83c\udfae\u2728<br><br>Forget about other running games\u2014our crazy runner will get you hooked for hours!<br><br>Here are the features of our scooter game:<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Crisp graphics: Unlike other runner games, this delivery game will surprise you with its bright visuals and the mega fun of a motorcycle race.<br>\u2728 Never-ending speed challenge: Test your skills and find out how good you are as a paper delivery boy to beat unique levels in this exciting bike delivery girls&amp;boys game.<br>\ud83d\udd25 Crazy rush: Drive ahead at high speed and make your bike run and jump over other cars to become the racing master of this girls&amp;boys game about racing.<br>\ud83c\udfae Addictive gameplay: Our scooter game will quickly become your favorite time-killer among other obstacle games, thanks to its intuitive mechanics.<br>\ud83d\udcf0 Fascinating paper delivery boy tasks: Deliver papers, dodge obstacles, and prove your paperboy or papergirl can complete every traffic rider mission in the race!<br>\ud83d\udef5 Plenty of vehicles: In this game, you can drive anything, from a skateboard to a motercycle!<br><br>Get on your motercycle and drive ahead to deliver every paper in this exciting run race 3D! Download our running sim and become the legendary racer of all runners! \ud83d\udef5\ud83c\udfc1\ud83c\udfae",
